## 💡 Code Conventions & Best Practices

1. **Type Safety**: Always update [`src/types/index.ts`](file:///Users/aryanchauhan/Downloads/guestbook-i/src/types/index.ts) when modifying domain entities.
2. **State & Content**: Store property content and static recommendations in [`src/data/content.ts`](file:///Users/aryanchauhan/Downloads/guestbook-i/src/data/content.ts) rather than hardcoding in view components.
3. **No-Tap Highlights**: Apply `no-tap-highlight` class to interactive buttons to ensure a smooth mobile web app experience.
4. **Icons**: Use icons from `lucide-react` sparingly with thin stroke width (`strokeWidth={1.5}`) to maintain a refined look.
